# Every scenario here must fail; @fail makes a pass the failure.

Feature: Things that should fail

  Background:
    Given I am Signed-in

  @fail
  Scenario: A typo
    When I Clik the Button "Add"

  @fail
  Scenario: Not really gone
    Given I Add "Bread"
    Then I should Not See the Cell "Bread"

  @fail
  Scenario: Wrong heading
    Then I should See the Heading "Welcome"

  @fail
  Scenario: No verb
    When the Button "Add"

  @fail
  Scenario: Not checked
    Given I Add "Eggs"
    Then the Checkbox "Bought" Within the Row Containing "Eggs" should be Checked

  @fail
  Scenario: Unclosed
    When I Click the Button "Add

  @fail
  Scenario: The wrong kind of thing
    When I Click "Add"

  @fail
  Scenario: Not every one
    Given I Add "Eggs"
    And I Add "Milk"
    When I Check the Checkbox "Bought" Within the Row Containing "Eggs"
    Then Each Checkbox "Bought" should be Checked

  @fail
  Scenario: Each of nothing
    Then Each Checkbox "Bought" should be Checked

  @fail
  Scenario: One of them is
    Given I Add "Eggs"
    And I Add "Milk"
    When I Check the Checkbox "Bought" Within the Row Containing "Milk"
    Then No Checkbox "Bought" should be Checked

  @fail
  Scenario: Not every one, when every one is
    Given I Add "Eggs"
    When I Check the Checkbox "Bought" Within the Row Containing "Eggs"
    Then Not Each Checkbox "Bought" should be Checked

  @fail
  Scenario: The wrong count
    Given I Add "Eggs"
    Then I should Count 2 Checkbox "Bought"

  @fail
  Scenario: The wrong order
    Then the Columnheader should Read:
      | Bought |
      | Item   |
      |        |
